Z||000031||artherd||08-18-2001||03:46 PM||||Clearly you have never competed in a Sanctioned motor racing event.<P>Walk a mile in the other guy's shoes.  <BR>That way, when he finds out, you'll be a mile away, and you'll have his shoes!!!<P>Hrm, that might not have come out the way I intended....<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ken Wittlief:<BR><B>if I drive my car on the highway at 70mph for several hours I feel pretty brain dead, exhausted and burned out.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
