Z||000035||hyhy4u||08-19-2001||06:12 AM||||Hey Guys...I could car less if you guys think its a sport..I live about 2 hours away from Indianapolis Motor speedway and a half hour away from Joliet..and ive been to bulls games when they where good..ive been to sox games when they where good..ive been around when the bears where good..let me tell ya something it dosnt even compare to Nascar..as far as its being fixed..yeah im sure they sit down all before and plan out every lap one by one and then they got a big clip board in there car that tells them..<P> Lap 58- Pass car 58, let car 75 get right behind you<BR>Lap 59- Race against car 58 for 2 laps..dont let any other cars by<BR>Lap 60- Hit the wall hard!!!<P>Come on Guys..think about it!||||reg||1
