Z||000060||Jimmy||08-20-2001||01:21 PM||||I used to think NASCAR wasn't a sport or that it was boring "all they do is drive around in circles?".<P>Man was I wrong!  NASCAR is most defintely a sport, its just people who don't understand it or have ignorant stereotypes about it that call it not a sport.<P>NASCAR is also America's Sport.  More people have been going to NASCAR events and buying NASCAR merchandise than any other sport for the last few years.  NASCAR brings in more fans than another profesional sport.<P>Try watching a NASCAR event sometime, I mean really sit down and pay attention to whats going on, I promise if your into cars and intense competition you'll get hooked.<P>Jim<BR>87 GT<BR>87 GT T-TOP V8||||reg||1
Z||000061||Songman||08-20-2001||02:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by frontal lobe:<BR><B>Songman,<BR>I know you are most likely indoors composing during the day, and possibly performing at night, but man, YOU'VE GOT TO GET A LITTLE SUNSHINE, BUDDY!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Those legs are WHITE!   Maybe go to a nascar race in shorts, possibly?<BR>Just joking with you.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I warned you! hehe... Guess I shoulda put the warning at the top of the post! *WARNING - Wear shades before reading any farther!<P>And thanks, Jimmy... And that is exactly what I said way back about 30 posts ago. Let the numbers speak. NASCAR is America's sport!<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||6
