Z||000075||Butter||08-22-2001||03:40 PM||||Songman,<BR>You be aw ite in my book. You've made a lot of good points.  Now let me tell yall all kinda what my cousin told me about racing.  He be at the Nashville Speedway on weekends racin' them there trucks. Number 99.7 Steve Pendergrass be my man for Nascar.  He won rookie of the year his first year out in Nascar, Placed 4th over the whole season and never won a race.  That's consistance, persistance, and down right good driving.<P>When he first started racing he checked out different tracks till he found a track that wanted to really race instead of playing demolition derby.  Got his shirt tail cut off at Summertown's track and finally got enough reconition to get a sponser.  Then he moved up to Nascar.  Sounds like training to me.  Now don't that sound like something a football, baseball, or for that matter any other kind of athlete might do to make it to the big leagues.  And yes DecadenceR, he tells me it is physically demanding and if you would pay close attention to a Nascar race you will see there is teamwork involved plus a lot mindwork from the driver while he is under stress.  Each vehicle on the track represents a team with one man driving the show.  <P>I think Nascar is the largest spectator SPORT in the world!  After all I have to brave the gravel, asphalt, and Nashville drivers just to see him race in person or I can just whatch him on TV.  Sound anything like monday night football too you?  Why don't you try some racing with a Bunch of HP thrown' you round and round and everybody on your a$$.  Then if you make it to the big leagues you can tell me what you think about Nascar as a sport.  I promise to give you some respect for this subject after that.<P>Nascar IS a SPORT.<P>2m8ed<BR>Nascar Fan||||reg||10
Z||000076||Kerri 98||08-22-2001||04:25 PM||||NASCAR IS A SPORT....I couldn't stand to waste my time reading all the BS on this topic, ALOT of physical training is done to prepare a driver for racing. Can't help but laugh at some of the ignorant comments made in relation to Nascar racing, WHO CARES if some of you don't think it is. I sure as hell don't. That's the end of my comment, I'm taking the checkered flag on this topic. GO DJ-88,DE JR-8,KH-29,RW-2......UGHHH JG-24||||reg||6
